    {
      "subId": "4024602",
      "subQuestName": "Go to the Wingalet's deck",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "402460201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "402460201": {
            "id": "402460201",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Citlali sure drank a lot last night, huh... Wonder if she's even awake...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460202"
            ]
          },
          "402460202": {
            "id": "402460202",
            "speakerId": 16252,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Good morning.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460203"
            ]
          },
          "402460203": {
            "id": "402460203",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Waah! C—Columbina! You, uh, sure know how to make an entrance... What are you doing here?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460204"
            ]
          },
          "402460204": {
            "id": "402460204",
            "speakerId": 16252,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "We just finished filming a last-minute scene, so I came up to get some fresh air.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460205"
            ]
          },
          "402460205": {
            "id": "402460205",
            "speakerId": 16252,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "The others are still down below discussing what the final scene should be.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460206"
            ]
          },
          "402460206": {
            "id": "402460206",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "You mean, how it should end?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460207"
            ]
          },
          "402460207": {
            "id": "402460207",
            "speakerId": 16252,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Yes. They're torn between whether the heroine should reunite with her old friend or not.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460208"
            ]
          },
          "402460208": {
            "id": "402460208",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ah... Because the whole point is that she came to her friend's homeland to search for her, right? Paimon almost forgot the plot...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460209"
            ]
          },
          "402460209": {
            "id": "402460209",
            "speakerId": 16252,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Yes. Director Furina and Miss Chiori think a tragic ending where the two never meet would be more poignant.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460210"
            ]
          },
          "402460210": {
            "id": "402460210",
            "speakerId": 16252,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "But Director Xavier thinks having the two reunite would make for a more touching and heartwarming ending.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460211"
            ]
          },
          "402460211": {
            "id": "402460211",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What do you think?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460212"
            ]
          },
          "402460212": {
            "id": "402460212",
            "speakerId": 16252,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Me? I... I'm not sure...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460213"
            ]
          },
          "402460213": {
            "id": "402460213",
            "speakerId": 16252,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "On a personal level, of course I want to see her again... of course I want to experience that moment where we reunite... even if it's just for the Kameras.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460214"
            ]
          },
          "402460214": {
            "id": "402460214",
            "speakerId": 16252,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "But that means... an actor would have to take her place, and that makes me feel...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460215"
            ]
          },
          "402460215": {
            "id": "402460215",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460216"
            ]
          },
          "402460216": {
            "id": "402460216",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Don't stress about that for now.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460217"
            ]
          },
          "402460217": {
            "id": "402460217",
            "speakerId": 16252,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Huh?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460218"
            ]
          },
          "402460218": {
            "id": "402460218",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yeah! Don't look so worried! Making a film is supposed to be fun!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460219"
            ]
          },
          "402460219": {
            "id": "402460219",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "B—Besides, it's all gonna work out! You can trust Paimon on that!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460220"
            ]
          },
          "402460220": {
            "id": "402460220",
            "speakerId": 16252,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Work out... how?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460221"
            ]
          },
          "402460221": {
            "id": "402460221",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Uh, well... Y'know...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460222"
            ]
          },
          "402460222": {
            "id": "402460222",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "It'll all get tied up in a nice little bow. You'll see.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460223"
            ]
          },
          "402460223": {
            "id": "402460223",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yep! Exactly!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460224"
            ]
          },
          "402460224": {
            "id": "402460224",
            "speakerId": 16252,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Hehe... Okay. I trust you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460225"
            ]
          },
          "402460225": {
            "id": "402460225",
            "speakerId": 16252,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "I'll just focus on having fun for now.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460226"
            ]
          },
          "402460226": {
            "id": "402460226",
            "speakerId": 1073,
            "speakerName": "Furina",
            "text": "#Well, well, look who we have here! {NICKNAME} and Paimon!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460227"
            ]
          },
          "402460227": {
            "id": "402460227",
            "speakerId": 1082,
            "speakerName": "Chiori",
            "text": "Aw, the lighting specialist and clapper loader that never were...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460228"
            ]
          },
          "402460228": {
            "id": "402460228",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Uh, yeah... We kinda went AWOL didn't we. Sorry about that.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460229"
            ]
          },
          "402460229": {
            "id": "402460229",
            "speakerId": 1082,
            "speakerName": "Chiori",
            "text": "Hehe, seriously, don't worry about it. Everything's going smoothly on our end, so just do what you need to do.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460232"
            ]
          },
          "402460232": {
            "id": "402460232",
            "speakerId": 1073,
            "speakerName": "Furina",
            "text": "You seem to be in better spirits now, Miss Columbina. I apologize if our earlier discussion put you on the spot...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460233"
            ]
          },
          "402460233": {
            "id": "402460233",
            "speakerId": 16252,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "#It's okay, I'm fine now. {NICKNAME} and Paimon talked me through it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460234"
            ]
          },
          "402460234": {
            "id": "402460234",
            "speakerId": 1073,
            "speakerName": "Furina",
            "text": "So, what are your thoughts on the ending then? Should we have them reunite or not?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460235"
            ]
          },
          "402460235": {
            "id": "402460235",
            "speakerId": 16252,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "We should... tie everything up in bows.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460236"
            ]
          },
          "402460236": {
            "id": "402460236",
            "speakerId": 1073,
            "speakerName": "Furina",
            "text": "...Huh?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4024612",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Citlali",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "402461201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "402461201": {
            "id": "402461201",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Citlali, we're here!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402461202"
            ]
          },
          "402461202": {
            "id": "402461202",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Oh, right on time.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402461203"
            ]
          },
          "402461203": {
            "id": "402461203",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Well, yeah... We weren't the ones who drank our weight in alcohol yesterday.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402461204"
            ]
          },
          "402461204": {
            "id": "402461204",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Heh, what? Are you suggesting granny can't handle her liquor? It takes a lot more than that to get me drunk.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402461205"
            ]
          },
          "402461205": {
            "id": "402461205",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Really? 'Cause, uh, you stopped making sense after a while...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402461206"
            ]
          },
          "402461206": {
            "id": "402461206",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Uh... Did I? Huh, news to me. I didn't say anything... too crazy, I hope.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402461207"
            ]
          },
          "402461207": {
            "id": "402461207",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Let's see... You spent half an hour badmouthing Ororon, half an hour complaining about work, an hour talking about light novels... and, uh, Paimon kinda fell asleep after that.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402461208"
            ]
          },
          "402461208": {
            "id": "402461208",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "...Are they gone?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402461209"
            ]
          },
          "402461209": {
            "id": "402461209",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hm? Oh, the crew? Yeah, we bumped into them on the deck, but they just left.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402461210"
            ]
          },
          "402461210": {
            "id": "402461210",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wait but, now that everything with your core is sorted out, what's stopping you from seeing Columbina? She misses you a lot!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402461211"
            ]
          },
          "402461211": {
            "id": "402461211",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "I... I just want to deal with this mess first. Besides, this is the perfect chance to make her jump for once. I have to plan it out more.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402461212"
            ]
          },
          "402461212": {
            "id": "402461212",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "But, enough about that. Were you able to pinpoint the location of our target?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402461213"
            ]
          },
          "402461213": {
            "id": "402461213",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Of course. When Granny Itztli promises something, she delivers!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402461214"
            ]
          },
          "402461214": {
            "id": "402461214",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "Great, let's see...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402461215"
            ]
          },
          "402461215": {
            "id": "402461215",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "The Morte Region... Wait, this is the Tower of Gestalt.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402461216"
            ]
          },
          "402461216": {
            "id": "402461216",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "The place the souls were severed... Is that the source of the resentment? Or is it the Narzissenkreuz Ordo in general?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402461217"
            ]
          },
          "402461217": {
            "id": "402461217",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Let me come with. This thing's movement isn't fixed. If it's not at this location when we get there, I can use a ritual to summon it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402461218"
            ]
          },
          "402461218": {
            "id": "402461218",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "You've already gone to more than enough trouble...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402461219"
            ]
          },
          "402461219": {
            "id": "402461219",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "I don't mind. These old bones have nothing better to do anyway. Summoning a spirit isn't going to do me in.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402461220"
            ]
          },
          "402461220": {
            "id": "402461220",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "(Besides, if I don't go, they'll just have more inside jokes I can't join in on!)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402461221"
            ]
          },
          "402461221": {
            "id": "402461221",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "Alright then. I appreciate it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402461222"
            ]
          },
          "402461222": {
            "id": "402461222",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hah, there's no time to lose. Let's head out!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
