    {
      "subId": "4024605",
      "subQuestName": "Check the space within the Tower of Gestalt",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "402460501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "402460501": {
            "id": "402460501",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "Huh, no sign of it so far...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460502"
            ]
          },
          "402460502": {
            "id": "402460502",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Should I start the summoning ritual?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460503"
            ]
          },
          "402460503": {
            "id": "402460503",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "Let's drain the water from this floor of the tower first. It'll make it easier to move around.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460504"
            ]
          },
          "402460504": {
            "id": "402460504",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wait, we can do that?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460505"
            ]
          },
          "402460505": {
            "id": "402460505",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "Of course. Alain and Rene both saw the future that awaited Fontaine, and even shared a few methods for waterproofing buildings. The principle behind it is...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460506"
            ]
          },
          "402460506": {
            "id": "402460506",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "...Ahem, not important. Just unlock the mechanisms in the order I tell you."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4024606",
      "subQuestName": "Empty the Tower of Gestalt of water",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4024607",
      "subQuestName": "Wait for Citlali to start the ritual",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "402460701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "402460701": {
            "id": "402460701",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Ready?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460702"
            ]
          },
          "402460702": {
            "id": "402460702",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "Yeah. When this thing appears, I'll try talking to the souls inside.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460703"
            ]
          },
          "402460703": {
            "id": "402460703",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "But, more than likely, they've already been driven to madness. If communication fails, we'll have a battle on our hands.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460704"
            ]
          },
          "402460704": {
            "id": "402460704",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "In that case, Paimon better find a hiding spot.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460705"
            ]
          },
          "402460705": {
            "id": "402460705",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "If a fight does break out, I should be the one to deliver the final blow. Trust me on that.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460706"
            ]
          },
          "402460706": {
            "id": "402460706",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Understood.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460707"
            ]
          },
          "402460707": {
            "id": "402460707",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Alright, I need quiet.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460708"
            ]
          },
          "402460708": {
            "id": "402460708",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "...Wandering spirits drifting along the tides, hear me now. Broken souls, silenced, torn apart, and forsaken, follow the traces of the past and return to us.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460709"
            ]
          },
          "402460709": {
            "id": "402460709",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "...Let resentment recognize resentment. Let vile entities be drawn together, and in this place, take form once more!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460710"
            ]
          },
          "402460710": {
            "id": "402460710",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460711"
            ]
          },
          "402460711": {
            "id": "402460711",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460712"
            ]
          },
          "402460712": {
            "id": "402460712",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "(...What now? Is that it?)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460713"
            ]
          },
          "402460713": {
            "id": "402460713",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "(Ugh... This is exactly why I deal in math not magic. How are we supposed to know what stage the spell is at? It's like there's no logic to speak of.)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460714"
            ]
          },
          "402460714": {
            "id": "402460714",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "(Mechanical science is so much easier to—)",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460715"
            ]
          },
          "402460715": {
            "id": "402460715",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "...!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460716"
            ]
          },
          "402460716": {
            "id": "402460716",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Watch out!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460717"
            ]
          },
          "402460717": {
            "id": "402460717",
            "speakerId": 31013,
            "speakerName": "Wandering Souls' Resentment",
            "text": "...!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460718"
            ]
          },
          "402460718": {
            "id": "402460718",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "Hey, you! Or whoever's inside of you... I need you to listen to me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460719"
            ]
          },
          "402460719": {
            "id": "402460719",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "I'm a descendant of Fontaine's \"Lord-Artificer,\" Alain Guillotin. I can make you whole again and return you to the Ley Lines. You just need to work with me here...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460720"
            ]
          },
          "402460720": {
            "id": "402460720",
            "speakerId": 31013,
            "speakerName": "Wandering Souls' Resentment",
            "text": "...!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460721"
            ]
          },
          "402460721": {
            "id": "402460721",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Sandrone!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460722"
            ]
          },
          "402460722": {
            "id": "402460722",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "Tch... Looks like talking this out is off the table.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460723"
            ]
          },
          "402460723": {
            "id": "402460723",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "Alright, plan B... Time to blow off some steam!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4024608",
      "subQuestName": "Defeat the opponent",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4024609",
      "subQuestName": "Defeat the opponent",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "402460901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "402460901": {
            "id": "402460901",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "...Is it over?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460902"
            ]
          },
          "402460902": {
            "id": "402460902",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "Yep. Told you it'd be a piece of cake.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460903"
            ]
          },
          "402460903": {
            "id": "402460903",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "How did you do that back there?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460904"
            ]
          },
          "402460904": {
            "id": "402460904",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "That creature was nothing special. Add a bunch of souls with nowhere to go, a touch of malicious energy, a few impurities, and a whole lot of resentment, and that's what you get.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460905"
            ]
          },
          "402460905": {
            "id": "402460905",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "All I did was separate the original souls from the rest of the filth, allowing them to be accepted by the current rules of the world.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460906"
            ]
          },
          "402460906": {
            "id": "402460906",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "The principle behind the world-formula is \"divergence.\" Starting from a point of origin, it deconstructs and reconstructs the possibilities of the world to find certain answers.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460907"
            ]
          },
          "402460907": {
            "id": "402460907",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "So, it would follow that reverse-calculating the world-formula allows us to achieve convergence and restoration instead. Using the numerological array, I was able to do just that.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460908"
            ]
          },
          "402460908": {
            "id": "402460908",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "It's similar to the concept of homological reduction in mathematics. I reduced them to the basic, fundamental essence of their being, without changing their underlying nature.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460909"
            ]
          },
          "402460909": {
            "id": "402460909",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "That meant... Ugh, never mind. Judging by all the blank stares, I'm guessing you don't actually care.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460910"
            ]
          },
          "402460910": {
            "id": "402460910",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "I think I finally understand how outlanders feel when I ramble on about Shaman stuff...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460911"
            ]
          },
          "402460911": {
            "id": "402460911",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "P—Point is, it was super impressive! You really are amazing, Sandrone!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460912"
            ]
          },
          "402460912": {
            "id": "402460912",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "Hah, you're just realizing that now?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460913"
            ]
          },
          "402460913": {
            "id": "402460913",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I'd expect nothing less from the Unraveller of All Reason...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460914"
            ]
          },
          "402460914": {
            "id": "402460914",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "Ahem, enough about that!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402460915"
            ]
          },
          "402460915": {
            "id": "402460915",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "W—We should get going! I'll go reset the mechanisms inside the tower. See you back on land!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4024610",
      "subQuestName": "Leave the Tower of Gestalt",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "402461001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "402461001": {
            "id": "402461001",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "Well, that's one old mess for the books. Glad to have that over and done with.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402461002"
            ]
          },
          "402461002": {
            "id": "402461002",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "Feels nice to do a good deed every once in a while.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402461003"
            ]
          },
          "402461003": {
            "id": "402461003",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "You helped everyone out a bunch in Nod-Krai, too! Kinda seems like you're just a good person at heart!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402461004"
            ]
          },
          "402461004": {
            "id": "402461004",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "Heh, I wouldn't be so sure. I'll be heading back to the Fatui soon enough. You two are too trusting sometimes...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402461005"
            ]
          },
          "402461005": {
            "id": "402461005",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Well, at the very least, we know we can trust you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402461006"
            ]
          },
          "402461006": {
            "id": "402461006",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "Hmph, fine. Just don't say I didn't warn you when it comes back to bite you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402461007"
            ]
          },
          "402461007": {
            "id": "402461007",
            "speakerId": 1096,
            "speakerName": "Citlali",
            "text": "Well, where to next? Back to the ship?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402461008"
            ]
          },
          "402461008": {
            "id": "402461008",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yeah! Your personal business, the Narzissenkreuz thing, it's all resolved. That means you can \"see the people that need seeing\" now, right Sandrone?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402461009"
            ]
          },
          "402461009": {
            "id": "402461009",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Everyone's gonna be so happy you're back!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402461010"
            ]
          },
          "402461010": {
            "id": "402461010",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "Heh... You wouldn't catch me dead admitting to this before, but... Yeah. I really have missed everyone.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402461011"
            ]
          },
          "402461011": {
            "id": "402461011",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "Columbina's a special case, though! This time, I'm definitely getting her back for all her annoying antics over the years!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4024611",
      "subQuestName": "Leave the Tower of Gestalt",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "402461101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "402461101": {
            "id": "402461101",
            "speakerId": 16252,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402461102"
            ]
          },
          "402461102": {
            "id": "402461102",
            "speakerId": 16252,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Um, Sandrone...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402461103"
            ]
          },
          "402461103": {
            "id": "402461103",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "Don't ruin the moment. Or I'll start thinking about how you teleported me to a random location after I explicitly told you to stop doing that...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402461104"
            ]
          },
          "402461104": {
            "id": "402461104",
            "speakerId": 16252,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "U—Um...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402461105"
            ]
          },
          "402461105": {
            "id": "402461105",
            "speakerId": 20624,
            "speakerName": "Xavier",
            "text": "Aaand... Scene! Bravo! Bravo! We got it! This is exactly the ending I was hoping for!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402461106"
            ]
          },
          "402461106": {
            "id": "402461106",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "...Huh!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402461107"
            ]
          },
          "402461107": {
            "id": "402461107",
            "speakerId": 1073,
            "speakerName": "Furina",
            "text": "Where did you just go, Miss Columbina? You vanished, and then the next second you were back, hugging this, um... new friend here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402461108"
            ]
          },
          "402461108": {
            "id": "402461108",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "Th—That... was all... on... Kamera...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402461109"
            ]
          },
          "402461109": {
            "id": "402461109",
            "speakerId": 1082,
            "speakerName": "Chiori",
            "text": "Yeah. Well, the Kamera was already rolling, and it happened so fast, so... Yeah.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402461110"
            ]
          },
          "402461110": {
            "id": "402461110",
            "speakerId": 1073,
            "speakerName": "Furina",
            "text": "Hold on, this must be...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402461111"
            ]
          },
          "402461111": {
            "id": "402461111",
            "speakerId": 16252,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Yep, my best friend. The one I was looking for. I never thought I'd actually get to see her again. I'm just... so happy.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402461112"
            ]
          },
          "402461112": {
            "id": "402461112",
            "speakerId": 16252,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "Plus, the film got a happy ending too. It's all thanks to you, Sandrone.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402461113"
            ]
          },
          "402461113": {
            "id": "402461113",
            "speakerId": 16252,
            "speakerName": "Columbina",
            "text": "...Sandrone?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "402461114"
            ]
          },
          "402461114": {
            "id": "402461114",
            "speakerId": 1319,
            "speakerName": "Marionette",
            "text": "You couldn't stop being annoying for one second!? Columbinaaaa!"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}